  "original_summary": "\r\n\r\n1. Inputs and outputs of the method:\r\n\t* Input: ModuleElement mdle\r\n\t* Output: List<String>\r\n2. Business purpose:\r\n\t* The method is used to retrieve a list of meta keywords for a given module.\r\n3. Detailed functional summary of the method:\r\n\t* The method first checks if the configuration object (config) has a \"keywords\" property set to true.\r\n\t* If it does, the method creates a new list of strings using the Arrays.asList() method.\r\n\t* The list contains the qualified name of the module (mdle.getQualifiedName()) followed by the string \"module\".\r\n\t* If the configuration object does not have the \"keywords\" property set to true, the method returns an empty list using the Collections.emptyList() method.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n"
